{
    "title": "Color by Number for Adults",
    "description": "Color by number pictures when you feel stressed and you want to relax. This coloring game can help you to relieve stress by coloring. Download a satisfying coloring book with a big amount of pictures to color. Color by number app for adults has more than 10,000 free images to color. Color new ones and get realistic results. Coloring is the best way to spend your leisure time. Color your life!\r\n\r\nFeatures of the color game:\r\n1. Coloring app has over 10,000 pictures to color. A large collection of pictures will not let you get bored. It helps you to spend your free time. You can find different themed coloring books.\r\n\r\n2. Every day you get images to color. There are different types of pictures that you can color. Daily you find new pictures from different themes in the color game: animals, birds, flowers, landscapes, mandalas, lifestyle, vehicles, and others. To color new images can take 1 or 2 hours a day. Your color game will be full of colored pictures. It will never stop.\r\n\r\n3. We have a large number of pictures that connect to holidays and other special events. Color images for Christmas, New Year, Halloween, Easter, Thanksgiving Day, etc. Create the atmosphere of the coming holidays.\r\nAlso, you will discover masterpieces that you can color. Themed pictures attract people of different age groups. \r\n\r\n4. Coloring book has lots of pictures\u2019 categories to color:\r\n\r\n\u201cPopular\u201d is the category with the most popular coloring images among the users. Color by number images from this category of the color game and maybe you find your favorite one to paint.\r\n\r\nIf you want to color something cute. Then choose a category with animals. There are different variants of animals in the app. Color soft and relaxing images of pets and animals.\r\n\r\nThe most beautiful flowers are waiting for you in the coloring games! Color vivid flowers to relieve your stress. \r\n\r\nOur game has exciting landscapes to color. Color the places where you were and not. This category allows you to color waterfalls, mountains, lakes, and others. Explore the world with the app.\r\n\r\nCategory with food allows you to color new and old recipes of your favorite dishes. Tasty coloring is something new for you. Color dishes and save them in your collections to repeat later.\r\n\r\nIf you don\u2019t know what you want to color, then choose the category \u201cColorful\u201d. There are lots of HD images for coloring.\r\n\r\nFind us on social media to find special pictures to color. Daily you can get pictures to color in our profile on Facebook, and Instagram. Color with other people!\r\n\r\nLots of people color images in the games every day then you can connect with them. Download it now and color with thousands of people! Color and forget all the troubles in your life.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Color by number pictures when you feel stressed and you want to relax. This coloring game can help you to relieve stress by coloring. Download a satisfying coloring book with a big amount of pictures to color. Color by number app for adults has more than 10,000 free images to color. Color new ones and get realistic results. Coloring is the best way to spend your leisure time. Color your life!<br><br>Features of the color game:<br>1. Coloring app has over 10,000 pictures to color. A large collection of pictures will not let you get bored. It helps you to spend your free time. You can find different themed coloring books.<br><br>2. Every day you get images to color. There are different types of pictures that you can color. Daily you find new pictures from different themes in the color game: animals, birds, flowers, landscapes, mandalas, lifestyle, vehicles, and others. To color new images can take 1 or 2 hours a day. Your color game will be full of colored pictures. It will never stop.<br><br>3. We have a large number of pictures that connect to holidays and other special events. Color images for Christmas, New Year, Halloween, Easter, Thanksgiving Day, etc. Create the atmosphere of the coming holidays.<br>Also, you will discover masterpieces that you can color. Themed pictures attract people of different age groups. <br><br>4. Coloring book has lots of pictures\u2019 categories to color:<br><br>\u201cPopular\u201d is the category with the most popular coloring images among the users. Color by number images from this category of the color game and maybe you find your favorite one to paint.<br><br>If you want to color something cute. Then choose a category with animals. There are different variants of animals in the app. Color soft and relaxing images of pets and animals.<br><br>The most beautiful flowers are waiting for you in the coloring games! Color vivid flowers to relieve your stress. <br><br>Our game has exciting landscapes to color. Color the places where you were and not. This category allows you to color waterfalls, mountains, lakes, and others. Explore the world with the app.<br><br>Category with food allows you to color new and old recipes of your favorite dishes. Tasty coloring is something new for you. Color dishes and save them in your collections to repeat later.<br><br>If you don\u2019t know what you want to color, then choose the category \u201cColorful\u201d. There are lots of HD images for coloring.<br><br>Find us on social media to find special pictures to color. Daily you can get pictures to color in our profile on Facebook, and Instagram. Color with other people!<br><br>Lots of people color images in the games every day then you can connect with them. Download it now and color with thousands of people! Color and forget all the troubles in your life.",
